{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD（2000MB/s 新版）帶來優惠，2TB 版本減 17% 至 US$352.51，500GB 版本則減 13% 至 US$139.99。這款外置 SSD 主打 USB-C 高速傳輸、IP65 防護與硬件加密，適合隨身攜帶及處理大型檔案。Amazon 頁面顯示兩個容量均可海外免費直送，毋須集運地址，可直接送到香港或台灣。有意升級高速外置儲存的話，現在是值得留意的入手時機。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD（2000MB/s 新版）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/71u6Lf-Jqm-L-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2>SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD（2000MB/s 新版） 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2000MB/s 高速讀取</strong>：採用 USB-C 3.2 Gen 2 介面，讀取速度最高可達 2,000MB/s，比上代快近兩倍；官方稱傳輸 1,000 張高解析相片不用 60 秒，適合快速備份及轉移大型檔案。</li>\n<li><strong>IP65 防水防塵機身</strong>：具備 IP65 防水防塵能力，可承受 3 米跌落，機身只有口袋大小，外出拍攝、通勤或旅行時可更安心攜帶，減少意外碰撞與環境因素造成的損壞風險。</li>\n<li><strong>跨裝置與硬件加密</strong>：配備 USB-C 介面，兼容 Windows、Mac、Android 手機及 iPad 等裝置；支援 256-bit AES 硬件加密，可設密碼保護私人檔案，2TB 容量亦足以直接在外置 SSD 上剪片及存放高解析素材。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GMX4CN7X?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"SANDISK 2TB Extreme Portable SSD, Up to 2000MB/s Transfer Speeds-New Model | External Solid State Drive, IP65 Water &amp; Dust Resistant, Up to 3M Drop Protection, 256-bit AES Encryption, USB-C 3.2 Gen 2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UpTn5oveL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GMX4CN7X?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SANDISK 2TB Extreme Portable SSD, Up to 2000MB/s Transfer Speeds-New Model | External Solid State Drive, IP65 Water &amp; Dust Resistant, Up to 3M Drop Protection, 256-bit AES Encryption, USB-C 3.2 Gen 2</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$352.51</p>\n<p>$423.76</p>\n<p>-17%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GMX4CN7X?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H6MF2MTN?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"SANDISK 500GB Extreme Portable SSD, Up to 2000MB/s Transfer Speed-New Model | External Solid State Drive, IP65 Water &amp; Dust Protection, Up to 3M Drop Protection, 256-bit AES Encryption, USB-C - Black\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UpTn5oveL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H6MF2MTN?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SANDISK 500GB Extreme Portable SSD, Up to 2000MB/s Transfer Speed-New Model | External Solid State Drive, IP65 Water &amp; Dust Protection, Up to 3M Drop Protection, 256-bit AES Encryption, USB-C - Black</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$139.99</p>\n<p>$159.99</p>\n<p>-13%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H6MF2MTN?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T21:24:06.444626+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1052,"images":3,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T21:02:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:38:00.075952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T21:17:32.397992+00:00","content_hash":"c99925d72afa33f7cddfff7adc387b60033ab001072440a8569e53833f3ee283","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}